/v1/","context":{"app_id":4636160,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4636160-1846651706691044","game_id":"steam-4636160","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest is here!","summary":"As I'm writing this, Steam Next Fest October 2026 starts in an hour. We have spent the past two weeks preparing for it, by polishing the demo build as much as we could.On the art side this meant recoloring a lot of assets to make sure they were more cohesive, as well as polishing old assets that weren't up to our standards anymore.We also added new assets, some of which were:A moonbeam with suspended dust motes in the witch's house:Also note the new sign to the library!Moving clouds for the main","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:20:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691044","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4636160-1844115010493196","game_id":"steam-4636160","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is released!","summary":"Our demo is finally out! It's been a few arduous months, but we finally released our free demo for you to play!The demo covers the early game, the focus was for the player to get introduced to the world and the game mechanics, without spoiling too much about the story or where it's going.You'll get to meet (almost) all the characters, gather shinies for Rowan, make recipes with Mephi, have your choice of critters to recruit, and feed cheese to poor Floki.The demo also has an early version of ach","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T20:15:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010493196","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4636160-1842212951305449","game_id":"steam-4636160","kind":"announcement","title":"Making our UI feel real : Dev blog #1","summary":"Something we both value in games is when the UI feels like a part of the world, what’s called diegetic UI. Since we are making all our assets ourselves by hand, this takes a fair bit of time.For example, we recently updated the night hub that has been in a placeholder state for months.As you can see, the buttons are just floating in the air, and have no connection to the world around them.How would you go about making this UI feel like a part of the world?Here’s the solution we went with:Instead","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-29T11:23:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951305449","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4636160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:17:03Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:17:03Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4636160":"2026-10-26T03:17:03Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4636160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:17:03Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:17:03Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5233160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:17:03Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:17:03Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4636160","app_id":4636160,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:43Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"0e7102af734